---
description: Mobile development constraints and required project context
globs:
  - "**/*.tsx"
  - "**/*.ts"
  - "app.json"
  - "app.config.*"
  - "eas.json"
  - "android/**"
  - "ios/**"
---

For mobile work:
- inspect Expo/React Native versions and existing native modules
- reuse navigation, API, auth and storage conventions
- never store secrets in plaintext mobile storage
- handle loading/error/offline states explicitly
- account for iOS and Android behavior
- preserve accessibility and touch target usability
- document new permissions, deep links and native config
